{c: Verse 1}
[Dm],        meghaa chhaye aadhee raat
[A] [Dm],        bairan ban gayee nindeeyaa
[D] [A],        bataa de main kyaa karu
[Dm] [A],        sab ke aangan diyaa jale re,
[C] [A],        more aangan jiyaa
[D],        hawaa laage shool jaisee,
[A],        taanaa maare chunareeyaan
[Dm],        aayee hain aansoo kee baaraat
[A] [Dm],        bairan ban gayee nindeeyaa
[Dm] [A],        ruthh gaye re sapane saare,
[C] [A],        toot gayee re aashaa
[D],        nain bahe re gangaa more,
[A],        fir bhee man hain pyaasaa
[Dm],        kise kahoo re man kee baat
